{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-100008",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "Writing $x$ as $\\frac{x}{1},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{7}x & =\\frac{2}{7}\\cdot x \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{7}\\cdot \\frac{x}{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot x}{7\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the expressions $\\frac{2}{7}x$ and $\\frac{2x}{7}$ are equivalent.",
